    "mcq": {
      "question": "<h3>Which of the following are scalar quantities?<br />(A) Work<br />(B) Momentum<br />(C) Electric current<br />(D) Pressure</h3>",
      "solution": "<p>Work, electric current and pressure have no direction, so they are scalars. Momentum is a vector. Correct options: A, C and D.</p>",
      "answer": [
        "A",
        "C"
      ],
