      "question": "<h3>A body falls freely from rest for 2 s (g = 10 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math>). Find the distance covered (in cm).</h3>",
      "solution": "<p>s = (1/2) g t<sup>2</sup> = (1/2) &times; 10 &times; 4 = 20 m</p>",
      "answer": "20",
