      "question": "<h3>A ball is thrown vertically upward with a speed of 20 m/s (g = 10 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math>). After how long does it return to the thrower's hand?<br />(A) 2 s<br />(B) 4 s<br />(C) 1 s<br />(D) 8 s</h3>",
      "solution": "<p>Time to reach the top = u/g = 2 s. Time to come back = 2 s. Total time = 4 s.</p>",
      "answer": "B",
