      "question": "<h3>Q.12 The value of g at the surface of the earth is about<br />(A) 9.8 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math><br />(B) 1.6 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math><br />(C) 98 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math><br />(D) 0.98 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></math><br />Space for rough work</h3>",
