    "scq": {
      "question": "<h3>A uniform rod of length L, pivoted at one end, is released from rest in the horizontal position. Its angular speed when it becomes vertical is<br />(A) &radic;(3g/L)<br />(B) &radic;(g/L)<br />(C) &radic;(2g/L)<br />(D) &radic;(6g/L)</h3>",
      "solution": "<p>Loss in potential energy = M g L/2 = (1/2) I &omega;<sup>2</sup> with I = M L<sup>2</sup>/3. So &omega; = &radic;(3g/L).</p>",
      "answer": "A",
      "quesImages": [],
